WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.850
Man...

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.520
...it's like I'm having
a bad nightmare or something.

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:35.070
It's not the kind of enemy
you can easily dismiss.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.450
It's the first time in my life...

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.740
...that I've seen a monster like that.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.370
Well, this really stinks.

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:46.750
I say we forget it.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.920
You can count me out.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.790
The same for me.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.980
Me, too.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.440
So...

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.740
...Domon Kasshu saw the
Devil Gundam before him...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.660
...and again, he has let it
and his master slip away.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.410
The reunion with Chibodee
and the others...

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.670
...the farewell to the
Shuffle Alliance...

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:35.130
...and his intense emotions
toward Master Asia...

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:39.170
What is Domon Kasshu's destiny?

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.340
Moreover...

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.340
...Schwarz Bruder of Neo Germany...

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:49.270
Neo Germany Gundam Spiegel

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.780
...who is this mysterious Fighter...

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.020
...who suddenly appeared...

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.790
...with his Gundam Spiegel?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.300
This story continues to take
exciting twists and turns.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.440
And now!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.570
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:05.910
Challenge!
The Mysterious Masked Fighter

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.870
Do not worry, Devil Gundam.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.130
It is true that Domon Kasshu
will come after us.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:15.840
However...

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.960
...with his overconfidence...

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.590
...it would be easy to use that to
our advantage and capture him.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.800
All units! Listen well!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.350
This is where we will attack.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.360
He will come here for certain!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.400
A battle...

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.860
...is not a battle won by aimlessly
throwing around one's powers.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.820
In combat, remember there are
nine geographic types...

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.950
...and fire, earth, wind and water.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.330
Yes. This is the perfect place
to stage an attack!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.250
You seem to be okay now.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.840
I'll take your temperature again.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.340
And as long as you eat properly...

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.800
I'd like to thank you
for rescuing us...

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:07.800
...Rain Mikamura.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.770
I hope you won't come to
regret saving us later on, though.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.140
I won't ask you to take it easy
on us during Gundam Fights.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.280
Let's go, Argo!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.410
Hi! Rain!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.700
See ya, Rain!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.950
Thanks again for saving us.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.880
It's back to the Gundam Fight.
Bye!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.080
Later.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.290
Bye! See ya!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:40.710
Goodbye.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:49.680
When are you going to
stop eating, Sai Saici?

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.970
How could you act this way...

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.890
...after confronting a new enemy?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.270
What's the big deal?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.770
At least I cooked it myself.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.270
Just the same.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.690
And besides...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.360
...the big guy at the Colony said to
get back to Gundam Fight matches.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.610
Right?

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.570
Guess you're the only ones...

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.360
...getting hung up on
the Devil Gundam.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:20.040
Now, George.
You must show your gratitude.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:23.880
Excuse me.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.590
Domon! Wait!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.010
Where are you going?!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.980
I'm going to bring Master back
by myself!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.610
The Devil Gundam, is it?

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.510
Domon, you're completely
worn out.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.490
Wait, Domon!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.870
The Devil Gundam has
disappeared, you know!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.490
Where are you going?!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.700
I know it headed south from Tokyo.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.080
As long as I can catch up...

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.800
Battles require mobility.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.680
If you fight only with force
and without a plan...

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.180
...you are bound to lose!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.100
It's Master Gundam!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.460
That's Master!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.110
As the art of war illustrates...

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.320
...battle is a mixture of simple
and mysterious tactics...

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.780
...and a constant use of these
is like the flow of water.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.870
Just as it appears...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.790
...that I'm right before you.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.550
Master!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.840
Where did that Gundam go?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.550
I'm going to find it!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:53.640
A good battle frowns upon
hasty actions.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.970
Understand your battle strength
as well as enemy movements.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.230
Those who ignore this
and take the enemy lightly...

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.520
...will fall into enemy hands.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.510
This applies to Domon Kasshu.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.420
Who's there?! Come out!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.620
Come out now!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.500
If you don't, I'll smash you and
the whole forest into tiny pieces!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.500
It's me, Domon Kasshu.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:34.970
You're the guy from before!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.520
Yes. It's Schwarz Bruder.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.810
And what do you think
you're doing?

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.320
I've come to stop you.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.610
I know exactly where
you're trying to go.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.780
I've been watching.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.030
First you save me...

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.780
...and now you want to
get in my way?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.950
This is for your own good.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.320
You must turn back.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.620
You've got no chance of winning.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.870
It's none of your business.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.000
I've got my own ideas about this!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.040
I'm telling you that...

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:09.630
...Master Asia already knows
what you're planning to do!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.220
What's this?

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.340
Has he figured out our plans?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.550
Listen, Domon Kasshu.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.560
You're not going to beat him
just because you're upset.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.560
What?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.020
And you lack the ability!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.980
What do you know?!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.040
Is that it?

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:44.370
You consider yourself a Gundam
Fighter, Domon Kasshu?!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.000
Why, you!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:59.080
Domon Kasshu...

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.810
Right now, you're just
carried away with the notion...

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.600
...that you're better
than the others.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.190
Not only will you have no chance
against the Devil Gundam...

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:12.690
...you couldn't even defeat
your teacher, Master Asia.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.030
Look, Domon!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.050
Ask this sword to tell you...

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.470
...what your abilities are.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.470
If you think I'm talking nonsense...

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.760
...come at me anytime.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.230
I'll be your opponent.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.220
Why, you...

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.480
Domon!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.320
That Gundam Fighter from
Neo Germany...!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.030
Who is he?!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.530
And what is his interest in Domon?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.460
Damn!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.800
What's his problem?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.340
What's so wrong about me
trying to save Master?!

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.430
It's rusted.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.520
How did he do that
with this sword?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.370
But...

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.660
...what was that?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.410
While I was fighting him...

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.430
...I felt a sense of familiarity.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.450
Just for a split second.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:54.680
Domon.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.170
Did you find something?

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.050
I didn't get much, but...

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.490
...he's Schwarz Bruder, a Gundam
Fighter from Neo Germany.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:07.300
He once fought what was
believed to be the Devil Gundam.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.560
He disappeared afterwards
until he surfaced in Shinjuku.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.900
No one has seen the face
behind the mask.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.360
No information on his identity.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.200
That's it.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.700
Wait.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.200
The Devil Gundam again?

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.740
Schwarz probably told you
that it's impossible.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.620
I know that's what he said.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.710
I've got a trump card with me.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.460
A trump card?

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.670
That's right.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.920
The Shining Gundam Super Mode!

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.390
Super Mode Shining Gundam

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:52.100
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.860
That's right.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.980
I still have the Super Mode.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.690
If I can get that activated...

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.570
...there's no way I'd ever lose...

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.150
...to any opponent!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.530
With that power...

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.120
...I'll be able to rescue Master
from the Devil Gundam!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.330
Domon!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.080
Wait up, Domon.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.170
Where do you think you're going?

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.670
Shut up!
I'm on my way to meet Master.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.800
Look over there!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.260
N-no way!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.890
There are six types of
geographic obstacles.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.480
He is heading for one of them.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.860
It is called the natural mesh.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.570
It has dense vegetation...

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.740
...making it almost impossible
to get through.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.570
Therefore...

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.030
...one would be wise to avoid it.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.030
Domon, of course,
will continue his chase.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.740
And as if falling into a trap...

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.910
...he will come to us
following our plan.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:54.790
Yes.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.210
To the very location
where we've set our trap.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.750
This is the Undefeated of the
East's Defense Formation.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.920
Once you're trapped,
you cannot escape.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.300
Prepare yourself.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.590
Hey, Domon.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:11.260
Don't you find this place
a little spooky?

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:11.930
Huh?

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:14.930
The road's divided.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:18.480
Don't worry.
Master once taught me about this.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.440
The side that first secures the
higher ground has the advantage.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.400
If you're searching for the enemy,
head to the mountains.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.780
That's standard war strategy.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.710
No!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.170
Fool...

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.210
Secondhand strategies
can get you hurt.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.960
You fell into our trap!
Now!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.170
Go!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.680
Rain!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.060
Gundam!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.740
There you are!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.830
Master?!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.660
Where's my Master?!
Master!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.340
Master...

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.220
...if you're not going to answer...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.010
...you'll see the power of
Shining Finger!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.350
Think again, Domon!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.450
S-stop it, please, Master.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.950
Listen to me...

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.450
I'm not interested.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.050
Domon...!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.420
Master...

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.670
...if you upset me...

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.550
...my S-super M-mode will...

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:14.150
I came, wondering
how you were doing...

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.100
...and find you like this.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.340
You look great, Domon!

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.620
Wh-what the...?!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.420
What the hell are you doing?!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.500
Master could be inside
one of them!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.920
You trying to kill him?!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.550
You fool!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:52.260
Haven't you figured out that
this is all a trap?

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:53.220
What?!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.350
But how?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.440
Think carefully.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.860
Your master predicted
every move you made...

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.650
...and you were lured
into this trap he set.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.320
That can't be...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.740
Anyone who knows
basic battle tactics...

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.830
...can easily read your mind,
Domon.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:19.870
In other words...

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.790
...you've already lost
against your master!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.580
You lie!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.170
I haven't lost this yet!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.540
I can still use the Super Mode!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.090
I challenge you!

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.920
I challenge you to
a Gundam Fight!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.420
Very well.

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.010
I accept your challenge.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.390
Gundam Fight!

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.600
Ready!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.890
Go!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:44.490
Domon!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.230
At least you have the power!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.190
However...!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.620
What's wrong?
You're fighting like a wild boar!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.590
What's wrong?
Your defense is weak!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.980
Domon!
What about your Super Mode?!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.190
Th-that's right.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.400
I have the Super Mode.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.400
My Super Mode!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.950
Domon! Stop it!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.030
What's the matter?!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.410
Where's that Super Mode?!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.040
Let's see it!

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.080
M-my anger...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.880
Where's my Super Mode?!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.170
Show me!
I dare you to show me!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.590
M-my power of anger...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:02.350
Please! Come out!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:07.640
Your Shining Finger
won't do you any good!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.020
What?!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.080
The outcome is clear.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.580
I don't need to finish you off.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.270
You should be ashamed of
your inexperience.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.470
I-I lost...

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.260
Domon...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.070
I recall three enemies
attacking Domon...

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:01.860
...but...

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:05.830
...one, two, three, four...

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.330
But there are four!
That means...?!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.750
Domon! Watch out!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.470
Sneaking in extra soldiers
during battle is also a strategy!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.340
Now that Neo Germany's
Gundam has left...

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.680
...Domon, say your prayers!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.720
This is it!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:49.500
That's...!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.250
It's the Super Mode!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.960
That's right!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.040
My Shining Gundam's...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:57.590
...Super Mode!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:07.100
This hand of mine
shines and roars!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.640
Its cry tells me to defeat you!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:10.930
Take this!

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:14.150
My love, my anger, my sorrow!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.770
Shining Finger!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.860
Go! Go! Go!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.650
There it is...

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.270
My Super Mode.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.050
But why now?

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.690
I had him in my grasp,
but I didn't finish him off.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.280
Knowing when to retreat
is a good strategy as well.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:05.110
What I'm concerned
about right now...

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.230
...is the Fighter from
Neo Germany.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.540
What is he plotting?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.000
Never mind!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.500
Listen up!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:16.080
We'll alter our combat strategies!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.290
We'll heighten our battle strength!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:22.210
But don't lose sight of them
for even a moment!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.770
Rain.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.940
I think Schwarz is right.
I'm an inexperienced Gundam Fighter.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:41.610
- Domon...
- Don't say anything.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.570
I can't use the Super Mode
when I want...

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:49.030
...and it activates when
I don't even call for it.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.040
It's obvious I lack fighting ability.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.210
I'm taking a trip so I can train.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.130
To the Guyana Highlands.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.420
Why go to a place like that?!

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.130
It's where I first trained.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:04.630
Yes.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:07.880
The place where I was
first trained by Master!

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.220
I will return there now!

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:33.160
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.530 --> 00:22:37.540
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:45.550
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:52.720
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:58.430
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:10.240
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:14.370
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:20.370
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.430
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:38.220
In order to encourage Chibodee...

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.560
...Shirley and the girls head
to the Guyana Highlands.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:43.060
The sparks fly between...

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:45.480
...Shining Gundam and Gundam Maxter.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:46.610
However...

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:50.240
...an unexpected
danger is waiting for them!

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.570
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.280
Steal the Secret!

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:56.750
Scheme of the Beautiful Warriors.

00:23:54.780 --> 00:24:01.360
Steal the Secret!
Scheme of the Beautiful Warriors

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:59.700
Ready! Go!
